  <HumanLeatherApparel_Abhorrent.stages.human_leather.label>人皮{0}</HumanLeatherApparel_Abhorrent.stages.human_leather.label>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Abhorrent.stages.human_leather.description>穿着人皮令人不安。谁能做出这种事？</HumanLeatherApparel_Abhorrent.stages.human_leather.description>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Abhorrent.stages.human_leather_1.label>人皮{0}（+1）</HumanLeatherApparel_Abhorrent.stages.human_leather_1.label>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Abhorrent.stages.human_leather_1.description>我穿得像个疯子。</HumanLeatherApparel_Abhorrent.stages.human_leather_1.description>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Abhorrent.stages.human_leather_2.label>人皮{0}（+2）</HumanLeatherApparel_Abhorrent.stages.human_leather_2.label>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Abhorrent.stages.human_leather_2.description>我觉得我的衣服上可能有张脸。哦，不……我的衣服*就是*一张脸。</HumanLeatherApparel_Abhorrent.stages.human_leather_2.description>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Abhorrent.stages.human_leather_etc.label>人皮{0} 等</HumanLeatherApparel_Abhorrent.stages.human_leather_etc.label>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Abhorrent.stages.human_leather_etc.description>我看起来像恐怖片里的怪人，而我也感觉自己正身处恐怖片之中。</HumanLeatherApparel_Abhorrent.stages.human_leather_etc.description>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Disapproved.stages.human_leather.label>人皮{0}</HumanLeatherApparel_Disapproved.stages.human_leather.label>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Disapproved.stages.human_leather.description>我不该穿着人皮衣物。</HumanLeatherApparel_Disapproved.stages.human_leather.description>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Disapproved.stages.human_leather_1.label>人皮{0}（+1）</HumanLeatherApparel_Disapproved.stages.human_leather_1.label>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Disapproved.stages.human_leather_1.description>我穿着人皮。我不喜欢这样。</HumanLeatherApparel_Disapproved.stages.human_leather_1.description>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Disapproved.stages.human_leather_2.label>人皮{0}（+2）</HumanLeatherApparel_Disapproved.stages.human_leather_2.label>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Disapproved.stages.human_leather_2.description>我为什么要穿这么多人皮衣物？我们应该有别的衣服给我穿……</HumanLeatherApparel_Disapproved.stages.human_leather_2.description>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Disapproved.stages.human_leather_etc.label>人皮{0} 等</HumanLeatherApparel_Disapproved.stages.human_leather_etc.label>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Disapproved.stages.human_leather_etc.description>我真该穿非人皮的衣物。我看起来像个疯子。</HumanLeatherApparel_Disapproved.stages.human_leather_etc.description>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Horrible.stages.human_leather.label>人皮{0}</HumanLeatherApparel_Horrible.stages.human_leather.label>
