  <HumanLeatherApparel_Horrible.stages.human_leather_1.label>人皮{0}（+1）</HumanLeatherApparel_Horrible.stages.human_leather_1.label>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Horrible.stages.human_leather_1.description>穿着这一身人皮衣物让我真的非常不适。</HumanLeatherApparel_Horrible.stages.human_leather_1.description>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Horrible.stages.human_leather_2.label>人皮{0}（+2）</HumanLeatherApparel_Horrible.stages.human_leather_2.label>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Horrible.stages.human_leather_2.description>我为什么穿着这么多人皮？这太可怕了！</HumanLeatherApparel_Horrible.stages.human_leather_2.description>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Horrible.stages.human_leather_etc.label>人皮{0} 等</HumanLeatherApparel_Horrible.stages.human_leather_etc.label>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Horrible.stages.human_leather_etc.description>我看起来像个怪人，这太骇人了！</HumanLeatherApparel_Horrible.stages.human_leather_etc.description>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Preferred.stages.human_leather.label>人皮{0}</HumanLeatherApparel_Preferred.stages.human_leather.label>
