  <HumanLeatherApparel_Preferred.stages.human_leather_1.description>我享受穿着他人皮肤的感觉。</HumanLeatherApparel_Preferred.stages.human_leather_1.description>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Preferred.stages.human_leather_2.label>人皮{0}（+2）</HumanLeatherApparel_Preferred.stages.human_leather_2.label>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Preferred.stages.human_leather_2.description>我穿着敌人的面孔。这让我很开心。</HumanLeatherApparel_Preferred.stages.human_leather_2.description>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Preferred.stages.human_leather_etc.label>人皮{0} 等</HumanLeatherApparel_Preferred.stages.human_leather_etc.label>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_Preferred.stages.human_leather_etc.description>我看起来像个真正的食人族。谁能质疑我？</HumanLeatherApparel_Preferred.stages.human_leather_etc.description>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_RequiredRavenous.stages.human_leather.label>人皮{0}</HumanLeatherApparel_RequiredRavenous.stages.human_leather.label>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_RequiredRavenous.stages.human_leather.description>我享受穿着他人的苦难。</HumanLeatherApparel_RequiredRavenous.stages.human_leather.description>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_RequiredRavenous.stages.human_leather_1.label>人皮{0}（+1）</HumanLeatherApparel_RequiredRavenous.stages.human_leather_1.label>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_RequiredRavenous.stages.human_leather_1.description>这会吓住他们。所有人都会知道我的力量。</HumanLeatherApparel_RequiredRavenous.stages.human_leather_1.description>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_RequiredRavenous.stages.human_leather_2.label>人皮{0}（+2）</HumanLeatherApparel_RequiredRavenous.stages.human_leather_2.label>
  <HumanLeatherApparel_RequiredRavenous.stages.human_leather_2.description>我衣服上的面孔并没有微笑，但它们让*我*开心。</HumanLeatherApparel_RequiredRavenous.stages.human_leather_2.description>
